至受支持的现代 Web 服务器平台（如 Apache/Nginx），迁移前可通过以下措施缓解：在 cgiwrap 配置中将虚拟站点隔离为独立系统用户，并严格限制 CGI 脚本的执行权限，确保每个虚拟站点无法访问其他站点的文件系统路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94209954200450&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94225629200045&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7764.php","http://www.osvdb.org/35","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/777","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1530","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/12677273468950fbc76c01ab77e7889ec07685f0/1999/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0af392497a1cfac74b8514a5a00b2012d39a1277/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-15xx/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1530.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1530.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1530.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1164.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0587","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0587.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0821","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9166,\"outputTokens\":16,\"totalTokens\":10846}}","description":"FreeBSD 系统下运行的 Seyon 2.1 rev. 4b（i586-Linux 版本）串口通信程序存在本地权限提升漏洞。该程序在处理 `-emulator` 命令行参数时未进行充分校验与边界检查，本地普通用户可通过在参数中指定恶意构造的程序路径来诱导 Seyon 以更高权限执行攻击者控制的代码。成功利用该漏洞后，本地用户能够获取特权账户权限，进而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞仅影响安装了存在缺陷版本 Seyon 的本地主机，攻击前提条件是攻击者需拥有目标系统的本地登录权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0821"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-11-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:07Z","remediation":"升级到已修复该问题的 FreeBSD 系统补丁版本（1999 年 11 月后的 seyon 修正包），或执行 `chmod u-s $(which seyon)` 移除 seyon 的 setuid(root) 位以消除本地提权条件。若无法立即升级，应限制 seyon 仅由可信用户通过 sudo 运行，并移除不可信用户的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/838","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/252","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe9e77bf3808998cc7ef33bc8a5ea311f35fadb0/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0821.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0821","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0821.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c8b0fec8b23470355b47059dbab5d2ebdfa2ac94/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0821.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/90b464bbc2d1b64270a5771429f96b67fbe9e79b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-27fc-7vgc-cg5g/GHSA-27fc-7vgc-cg5g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0821.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/838/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0587.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0587.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0663","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0663.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0863","title":"FreeBSD seyon 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统自带的 seyon 通信终端程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当程序处理 HOME 环境变量、-emulator 命令行参数或 -modems 命令行参数，或通过其图形用户界面（GUI）输入时，未对输入长度进行边界校验，导致特制超长输入可覆盖栈上返回地址。本地攻击者只需在启动 seyon 前设置恶意的 HOME 环境变量，或传入超长的 -emulator/-modems 参数，即可触发溢出并可能执行任意代码或造成程序崩溃。该漏洞影响存在 seyon 组件的 FreeBSD 系统版本，攻击需具备本地用户权限或能影响目标用户启动程序的环境，CVSS 基础评分 4.6，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0863"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级到包含修复的 FreeBSD 版本（FreeBSD 3.3-RELEASE 及之后已修复该 seyon 漏洞）。如无法立即升级，可移除或限制 seyon 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/X11R6/bin/seyon），避免以特权身份运行；同时限制普通用户对 HOME 环境变量及 -emulator/-modems 参数的可控输入，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0863","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5a67adc3536b9edff12a57c2de9cd5aa5d12653d/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0863.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fcr3-f7x4-9pjv/GHSA-fcr3-f7x4-9pjv.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0863.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0663.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1984","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1984.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1529","title":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall SMTP 网关 HELO 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall for NT 的 SMTP 网关在处理 HELO 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标系统的 25 号端口发送超长 HELO 命令触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致在受影响系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Interscan VirusWall 3.23 及 3.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1529"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:38Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Trend Micro 后续发布的 Interscan VirusWall 补丁版本（如 3.3x 以上），或迁移至 Trend Micro 当前支持的 InterScan Messaging Security 系列产品。如无法升级，可在网络边界 SMTP 网关上配置 HELO 命令长度限制（建议不超过 64 字节），并在防火墙上限制对 VirusWall SMTP 端口的来源 IP 为可信邮件服务器，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94201512111092&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94204166130782&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94210427406568&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94199707625818&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94208143007829&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/55551","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/787","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3465","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1529.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1529","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1529.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1529.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mmh6-2vw6-82r4/GHSA-mmh6-2vw6-82r4.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/interscan_dos.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1529.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/787/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--53e2c3f1-793e-42c4-ac61-c7fed198198f.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1984.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1166","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1166.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1533","title":"Eicon Networks DIVA ISDN Modem login.htm 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Eicon Networks DIVA LAN ISDN Modem 1.0/2.0 的 HTTP 服务中 login.htm 页面存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需认证即可向该页面发送超长密码参数，触发缓冲区溢出导致设备死机或重启，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Eicon DIVA LAN ISDN Modem 1.0/2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1533"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-11-07T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:38Z","remediation":"Eicon Networks 已停止支持 DIVA ISDN Modem 系列产品，建议将设备隔离或更换为受支持的替代产品。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制对设备 HTTP 管理端口（TCP 80）的访问，仅允许受信任的内部管理 IP 连接，并禁止外部网络访问该端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=93846522511387&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/665","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3317","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19513"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1166.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1166.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1166.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1193","fi